<Simple lang="en" title="About" eyebrow="About" description="The Meowpany is a studio in Montevideo, Uruguay, building websites, online stores and custom software for businesses in Uruguay and teams abroad." lead="We are a development studio in Montevideo, Uruguay. We build websites, online stores and custom software, and add capacity to teams abroad.">
  <h2>How we are organized</h2>
  <p>The Meowpany is made up of partner developers who work by project: the person who presents your proposal is the person who builds your system. A designer joins each project for the interfaces, and an external accountant keeps the books.</p>
  <p>We work fully remotely, by video call, in a time zone 1 to 2 hours ahead of US Eastern time.</p>

  <h2>Mission</h2>
  <p>Build websites, online stores and custom software that grow our clients' sales and productivity, with transparent prices, deadlines met and close support.</p>

  <h2>Values</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Transparency:</strong> fixed quotes and progress the client can see.</li>
    <li><strong>Verifiable quality:</strong> tested, secure and documented code.</li>
    <li><strong>Reliability:</strong> the committed date holds, and risks are flagged early.</li>
    <li><strong>Continuous learning:</strong> including applied artificial intelligence.</li>
    <li><strong>Responsibility:</strong> client data protected under Uruguay's Law 18,331.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we work inside</h2>
  <p>We run on our own platform, which keeps everything about each project in one place. That lets us include, at no extra cost:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Function point estimates (IFPUG), itemized function by function.</li>
    <li>Requirements specifications with acceptance criteria, following ISO/IEC/IEEE 29148.</li>
    <li>Critical-path planning, so delays are flagged before they happen.</li>
    <li>Tests linked to each requirement, with a report on every delivery.</li>
    <li>A weekly report with hours, finished and upcoming work, reviewed by a person before it is sent.</li>
    <li>A support desk that logs every request, its response deadline and the hours used.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We also reuse our own library of tested modules (payments, change auditing, exact money handling, among others). Every system is designed for its client, but none starts from scratch, which cuts timelines and defects.</p>

  <CtaBand slot="after" lang="en" title="Get to know us through your own project" text="The best way to judge us is to see your idea working. Within 72 hours, before you pay anything." />
</Simple>
